@startuml 详细时序图-部门审核申请
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #1890ff
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #e6f7ff
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam linetype ortho

title 详细时序图：部门审核申请（含对象创建/销毁、分支）

actor "部门管理员" as DeptAdmin
participant "Department\nApplications.vue" as Vue
participant "Application\nController" as Ctrl
participant "Application\nService" as Svc
participant "Application\nMapper" as AppMapper
participant "Notification\nService" as NotifySvc
participant "Notification\nMapper" as NotifyMapper
database "MySQL" as DB

DeptAdmin -> Vue: 进入申请审核页

Vue -> Ctrl: GET /api/applications?deptId=X&page=1
Ctrl -> Svc: listByDept(deptId, page, size)
Svc -> AppMapper: selectPage(deptId)
AppMapper -> DB: SELECT a.*, u.real_name, u.phone, u.major,\n  j.title as job_title\nFROM job_application a\n  JOIN sys_user u ON a.user_id = u.id\n  JOIN job j ON a.job_id = j.id\nWHERE j.department_id = ?\nORDER BY a.apply_time DESC
DB --> AppMapper: 结果集
AppMapper --> Svc: Page<ApplicationVO>
Svc --> Ctrl: PageResult
Ctrl --> Vue: 分页数据
Vue --> DeptAdmin: 展示申请表格

DeptAdmin -> Vue: 点击某条申请的"审核"

alt 审核通过
  DeptAdmin -> Vue: 选择"通过" + 设置面试时间\n填写审核备注(选填)
  Vue -> Ctrl: PUT /api/applications/{id}\n{status:1, interviewTime, auditRemark}
  Ctrl -> Svc: auditApplication(id, dto)
  Svc -> AppMapper: updateById(app)
  AppMapper -> DB: UPDATE job_application\nSET status=1, audit_remark=?,\n  interview_time=?, audit_time=NOW()\nWHERE id=?
  DB --> AppMapper: OK

  ' 创建通知对象
  Svc -> NotifySvc: createNotification(app.userId,\n"申请已通过",\n"您投递的岗位申请已通过审核",\ntype=2)
  create Notification <<新对象>>
  NotifySvc -> NotifyMapper: insert(notification)
  NotifyMapper -> DB: INSERT INTO notification\n(user_id, title, content, type, related_id)\nVALUES (...)
  DB --> NotifyMapper: OK
  destroy Notification
  NotifyMapper --> NotifySvc: success
  NotifySvc --> Svc: 通知已生成
  Svc --> Ctrl: success
  Ctrl --> Vue: {code:200}
  Vue --> DeptAdmin: "审核通过，已通知学生"

else 审核拒绝
  DeptAdmin -> Vue: 选择"拒绝" + 填写拒绝原因(必填)
  Vue -> Ctrl: PUT /api/applications/{id}\n{status:2, auditRemark}
  Ctrl -> Svc: auditApplication(id, dto)
  Svc -> AppMapper: updateById(app)
  AppMapper -> DB: UPDATE job_application\nSET status=2, audit_remark=?,\n  audit_time=NOW()\nWHERE id=?
  DB --> AppMapper: OK

  Svc -> NotifySvc: createNotification(app.userId,\n"申请未通过",\n"原因: " + auditRemark,\ntype=2)
  create Notification <<新对象>>
  NotifySvc -> NotifyMapper: insert(notification)
  NotifyMapper -> DB: INSERT INTO notification (...)
  DB --> NotifyMapper: OK
  destroy Notification
  NotifyMapper --> NotifySvc: success
  NotifySvc --> Svc: 通知已生成
  Svc --> Ctrl: success
  Ctrl --> Vue: {code:200}
  Vue --> DeptAdmin: "已拒绝该申请，已通知学生"

else 审核备注不足10字
  Vue -> Vue: 前端校验拒绝原因\n< 10字，拒绝提交
  Vue --> DeptAdmin: "拒绝原因不少于10字"
end

@enduml
